---
import { AFFILIATE_ENABLED } from '../affiliates';
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="footer-content">
		<div class="footer-brand">
			<span class="logo-v">V</span>amos<span class="logo-j">J</span>ogando
		</div>
		<p class="footer-desc">Seu portal autônomo de notícias sobre o mundo dos videogames. Atualizado diariamente via Inteligência Artificiail.</p>
		<div class="footer-social">
			<a href="https://www.twitch.tv/vamosjogando" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Twitch">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor">
					<path d="M11.571 4.714h1.715v5.143H11.57zm4.715 0H18v5.143h-1.714zM6 0L1.714 4.286v15.428h5.143V24l4.286-4.286h3.428L22.286 12V0zm14.571 11.143l-3.428 3.428h-3.428l-3 3v-3H6.857V1.714h13.714z"/>
				</svg>
				<span>Twitch</span>
			</a>
			<a href="https://www.youtube.com/@vamosjogando" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor">
					<path d="M23.5 6.19a3.02 3.02 0 0 0-2.12-2.14C19.5 3.5 12 3.5 12 3.5s-7.5 0-9.38.55A3.02 3.02 0 0 0 .5 6.19 31.6 31.6 0 0 0 0 12a31.6 31.6 0 0 0 .5 5.81 3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.12 2.14c1.88.55 9.38.55 9.38.55s7.5 0 9.38-.55a3.02 3.02 0 0 0 2.12-2.14A31.6 31.6 0 0 0 24 12a31.6 31.6 0 0 0-.5-5.81zM9.55 15.57V8.43L15.82 12z"/>
				</svg>
				<span>YouTube</span>
			</a>
		</div>
		{AFFILIATE_ENABLED && (
			<p class="footer-affiliate">
				Este site contém links de afiliado. Ao comprar através deles,
				você ajuda a manter o Vamos Jogando sem custo adicional.
			</p>
		)}
		<div class="footer-copy">
			&copy; {today.getFullYear()} Vamos Jogando. Todos os direitos reservados.
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		background: rgba(8, 9, 13, 0.95);
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 5rem;
	}
	.footer-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	.footer-brand {
		font-family: var(--font-title);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #ffffff;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}
	.logo-v {
		color: var(--neon-purple);
		text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-purple-glow);
	}
	.logo-j {
		color: var(--neon-cyan);
		text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan-glow);
	}
	.footer-desc {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		max-width: 500px;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.footer-affiliate {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		max-width: 500px;
		margin: 0 auto 1rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.footer-social {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.footer-social a {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.footer-social a:hover {
		color: var(--neon-cyan);
		background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05);
		border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
		text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-cyan-glow);
	}
	.footer-copy {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		width: 100%;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
